  "title": "Nepal PM Balendra Shah's India Visit",
  "summary": "Nepal Prime Minister Balendra Shah will visit India on November 22-23, with plans to sign Memorandums of Understanding and inaugurate projects. The event is expected to address both domestic challenges and regional development opportunities. Foreign Secretary Vikram Misri will visit Nepal on November 4-5, with discussions on Balendra Shah's India visit and appointments of Nepal's new Ambassador to India, along with disaster assistance following flash floods.",
